  "releaseNotes": "Important Breaking Changes:\nThis is a major release where all the controls and components have been re-developed from the ground up. The name has been improved to better identify the package and it's target platform.\n\nSiticone NetCoreUI is a better name and self-explanatory, a .NET Core UI Library for WinForms Desktop App Development.\n\nUse this on a new project as most, if not all, components come with new names, properties and breaking changes.\n\nThis is the first most advanced version of the 2025 product versions, superior and more powerful.",
